  "title": "Disney's Ratatouille",
  "description": "Ratatouille is a rich and elegant French summer vegetable and tomato side dish made by baking sliced eggplant, zucchini, and squash until tender.",
  "authors": [
    "Juli Warfel Bitler"
  ],
